# Drawing from an empty library (CR 121.4) does not stop the rest of the effect: Bot1's library is empty when the Sphinx's
# attack trigger resolves, so the draw does nothing, the discard still happens (a Forest goes to the graveyard) and Bot1
# loses the next time state-based actions are checked (CR 704.5b). Bot2 wins.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Sphinx of False Conclusions
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest
Island

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Sphinx of False Conclusions.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Sphinx of False Conclusions > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Forest)

[Expect]
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.Library.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Forest; Black Lotus
